 - 2026-06-05: Contamination-free FORMAL core 5-seed CI replication (the depth anchor): replicate exp3826's formal_only=0.8947 / full=0.9131 / learned=0.8699 decomposition across 5 disjoint seeds, report per-condition mean +/- CI95, and a positive control, so the contamination-free moat floor is paper-citable per the Adversarial-Confirmation Discipline. (✅ Complete) — honest_verdict=complete: formal_core_5seed_CONFIRMED_formalonly0.8947_full0.9131_contamination_free_ci0.0209; results/experiment_3835_formal_core_5seed_ci.json
 - 2026-06-05: Ship a CERTIFIED abstention operating point on the FORMAL CORE ONLY (gated on Exp 3835 formal_only_auroc_mean >= 0.85): build the risk-coverage (AURC) curve on the contamination-free formal scorer (0.9*tier0r + 0.1*tier0u, NO learned probe) and select a split-conformal-certified threshold at a fixed selective-risk target — the cleanest possible product claim (no learned-probe contamination + a certified guarantee). (✅ Complete) — honest_verdict=complete: formal_core_certified_abstention_threshold0.9_coverage1.0_at_risk_0.05_contamination_free; results/experiment_3836_formal_core_certified_abstention_operating_point.json
 - 2026-06-05: Characterize the LEARNED-probe contribution HONESTLY (the +0.0184 full-minus-formal gap): per-error-category breakdown of which step-error subtypes the learned fr11_session_memory probe catches that the contamination-free formal core MISSES — bounding exactly where the formal core has gaps, for the paper's limitations section. (✅ Complete) — honest_verdict=complete: learned_contribution_characterized_topgap_arithmetic_formal_core_blindspots_documented; results/experiment_3837_fover_error_category_learned_contribution.json
+- 2026-06-05: FR-11 continuous self-learning v22 — Tier-4 ADAPTIVE-STRUCTURE on the live verifier (the one untried tier; v17 was Tier-1 reweight, v18 Tier-2 memory, v19/v20/v21 Tier-3 predict). Across the FoVer corpus, accumulate per-verifier marginal contribution and PRUNE verifiers whose contribution is below a threshold, while FLAGGING residual error regions no verifier catches — confirm the pruned structure holds the frozen 0.9131 within CI while shrinking the active verifier set (compute saving). (✅ Complete) — honest_verdict=complete: fr11_v22_tier4_adaptive_structure_pruned2_auroc0.9132_in_frozen_ci_compute_saving0.50_residual_flagged_state_persisted; results/experiment_3838_tier4_adaptive_structure.json
